  _headline: Zona comercial abre, e a vitrine chama
  _headlineEn: Commercial zone opens, shop windows beckon
  _body: "Lojas e servi\xE7os geram emprego e arrecada\xE7\xE3o, e tamb\xE9m tr\xE2nsito.
    Dona Cida avalia a concorr\xEAncia com uma sobrancelha."
  _bodyEn: Shops and services bring jobs and revenue, and traffic too. Mrs. Cida
    sizes up the competition with one eyebrow.
